      │           └─ project (a, k) (rows≈3 cost≈76)
      │              └─ filter (< |t.id| 4) (rows≈3 cost≈40)
      │                 └─ source t AS t row-groups (< |t.id| 4) (rows≈5 cost≈20)
      └─ project (col1, __join_key_1__) (rows≈5 cost≈360)
